{title: Kabhi Jo Baadal Barse}
{artist: Arijit Singh Jackpot Sharib Toshi}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
Kabhi jo [Cm]baadal bar [A#]se,        Main dekhu tujhe [G#]aankhe bhar [A#]ke
Tu lage muze [Cm]pehli ba [A#]rish ki du [Gm]a,        [Fm] .. [A#] .. [G#]
[Fm] ... [A#] .. [G#],        Tere [Cm]pahloo mein reh [A#]loon
Main khud ko [G#]paagal keh [A#]loon,        Tu gam de ya [Cm]khushiya seh [A#]lu sathi [Gm]ya
[Fm] .. [A#] .. [G#],        [Fm] ... [A#] .. [G#]
[Cm]Koi nahi [A#],        Tere siva [G#]mera yahaan [A#]
[Cm]Manzilein [A#],        Hain meri to [G#]sab yahan [A#]
Mita de sabhi [Cm]aaja faas [A#]le,        Main chahoon mujhe [G#]mujhse baant [A#]le
Zaraa sa mujh [Cm]mein tu jhaank [A#]le,        Main hoon [Gm]kya
[Fm] .. [A#] .. [G#],        [Fm] ... [A#] .. [G#]
[Cm]Pehle kabhi [A#],        Na tune mujhe [G#]gham diya [A#]
[Cm]Phir mujhe [A#],        Kyun tanha [G#]kar diya [A#]
Guzaare the jo [Cm]lamhe pyaar [A#]ke,        Hamesha tujhe [G#]apna maan [A#]ke
To phir tune [Cm]badli kyoon [A#]adaa,        Yeh kyoon [Gm]kiya
[Fm] .. [A#] .. [G#],        [Fm] ... [A#] .. [G#]
Kabhi jo [Cm]badal [A#]barse,        Main dekhoon tujhe [G#]aankhein [A#]bharke
Tu lage muze [Cm]pehli ba [A#]rish ki du [Gm]a,        Tere [Cm]pahloo mein reh [A#]loon
Main khud ko [G#]paagal keh [A#]loon,        Tu gam de ya [Cm]khushiya seh [A#]lu [Gm]sathiya
